<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθ-αίρετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>self-chosen, self-elected,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηγοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.7.29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανηφόρος</span>
			<i>voluntary,</i> i.e. undertaking the duty at one's own expense, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.Mitt.</u>
				36.159
			</span></i> (Syros, <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).660
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				668
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνασίαρχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					583.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνήγορος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1242.10
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Magn.</u>
					163.15
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				2.280.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>by free choice, of one-self,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				931
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. ἐξῆλθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
					8.17
				</span></i>
			; <i>independent, free,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐβουλία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.78
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ τέλους ἔφεσις οὐκ αὐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1114b6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of things,
				<i>due to one's own choice,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄλβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; usu. of evils, <i>self-incurred,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πημοναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1231
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ αὐθαίρετοι βροτοῖς ἔρωτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					339
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσοι . . αἱ μέν εἰσ᾽
			αὐ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				292.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνδυνοι, δουλεία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάνατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.2.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῦπαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					634
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυστύχημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					618
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>of free choice,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ma.</u>
					6.19
				</span></i>
			, al., Mitteis <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				361
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πείθεσθαί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pel.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			, <i>independently,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Anach.</u>
				34
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
